<header class="hero">
  <h1>Laboratório Profiler</h1>
  <p class="meta">Um app Rails feito para ser lento de proposito, para voce ler o painel do rack-mini-profiler.</p>
</header>

<section class="stats">
  <% @stats.each do |name, value| %>
    <div class="stat">
      <span class="stat-value"><%= number_with_delimiter(value) %></span>
      <span class="stat-label"><%= name %></span>
    </div>
  <% end %>
</section>

<section class="howto">
  <div class="step"><span class="n">1</span><div><strong>Badge</strong><br>no canto superior direito mostra o tempo total da request.</div></div>
  <div class="step"><span class="n">2</span><div><strong>Arvore</strong><br>clique no badge: cada linha e' um passo (action, view, SQL, step).</div></div>
  <div class="step"><span class="n">3</span><div><strong>SQL</strong><br>clique no numero de queries para ver o SQL com backtrace.</div></div>
</section>

<h2>Cenarios</h2>
<div class="scenarios">
  <div class="scenario">
    <h3>1. N+1</h3>
    <p>Dezenas de <code>SELECT ... WHERE id = ?</code> marcadas <code>dup</code> viram 3 queries com <code>includes</code>.</p>
    <div class="pair">
      <%= link_to n_plus_one_path, class: "btn bad" do %>ruim <small>~150ms</small><% end %>
      <span class="arrow">&rarr;</span>
      <%= link_to n_plus_one_fixed_path, class: "btn good" do %>bom <small>~23ms</small><% end %>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="scenario">
    <h3>2. Render de view</h3>
    <p>Uma linha de render por item na arvore vs. uma unica linha.</p>
    <div class="pair">
      <%= link_to slow_view_path, class: "btn bad" do %>ruim <small>~50ms</small><% end %>
      <span class="arrow">&rarr;</span>
      <%= link_to slow_view_fixed_path, class: "btn good" do %>bom <small>~25ms</small><% end %>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="scenario">
    <h3>3. Indice</h3>
    <p>Mesma consulta, mesma quantidade; so' muda o indice.</p>
    <div class="pair">
      <%= link_to missing_index_path, class: "btn bad" do %>ruim <small>~290ms</small><% end %>
      <span class="arrow">&rarr;</span>
      <%= link_to with_index_path, class: "btn good" do %>bom <small>~44ms</small><% end %>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="scenario">
    <h3>4. Cache</h3>
    <p>Recarregue a versao com cache: o step continua la', mas sem SQL embaixo.</p>
    <div class="pair">
      <%= link_to uncached_path, class: "btn bad" do %>ruim <small>~47ms</small><% end %>
      <span class="arrow">&rarr;</span>
      <%= link_to cached_path, class: "btn good" do %>bom <small>~7ms</small><% end %>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="scenario">
    <h3>5. Contagem</h3>
    <p><code>posts.count</code> (1 query por usuario) vs <code>counter_cache</code> (zero queries).</p>
    <div class="pair">
      <%= link_to "count x counter_cache", counting_path, class: "btn" %>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="scenario">
    <h3>6. Fora do SQL</h3>
    <p><code>Rack::MiniProfiler.step</code> nomeia tempo que nao e' SQL nem view. Use <code>?pp=flamegraph</code>.</p>
    <div class="pair">
      <%= link_to "API externa", external_api_path, class: "btn" %>
      <%= link_to "CPU em Ruby", ruby_heavy_path, class: "btn" %>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<h2>Atalhos <code>?pp=</code></h2>
<p class="meta">Anexe a query string em qualquer URL deste app.</p>
<div class="chips">
  <div class="chip"><a href="/?pp=help" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><code>?pp=help</code></a><span>lista todos os comandos</span></div>
  <div class="chip"><a href="/?pp=disable" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><code>?pp=disable</code></a> / <a href="/?pp=enable" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><code>?pp=enable</code></a><span>liga e desliga na sessao</span></div>
  <div class="chip"><a href="/n_plus_one?pp=normal-backtrace" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><code>?pp=normal-backtrace</code></a><span>so' codigo da app (default)</span></div>
  <div class="chip"><a href="/n_plus_one?pp=full-backtrace" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><code>?pp=full-backtrace</code></a><span>inclui gems e Rails</span></div>
  <div class="chip"><a href="/n_plus_one?pp=profile-gc" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><code>?pp=profile-gc</code></a><span>alocacao e garbage collection</span></div>
  <div class="chip"><a href="/n_plus_one?pp=analyze-memory" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><code>?pp=analyze-memory</code></a><span>objetos vivos no processo</span></div>
  <div class="chip"><a href="/?pp=env" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><code>?pp=env</code></a><span>Rack env completo</span></div>
  <div class="chip"><a href="/ruby_heavy?pp=flamegraph" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><code>?pp=flamegraph</code></a><span>flamegraph (gem <code>stackprof</code>)</span></div>
</div>

<h2>Roteiro sugerido</h2>
<ol class="route">
  <li>Abra <strong>N+1 ruim</strong> e conte as queries no badge. Depois abra a versao <strong>boa</strong>.</li>
  <li>Em <strong>Render de view</strong>, olhe quantas linhas de render aparecem na arvore.</li>
  <li>Em <strong>Indice</strong>, compare o tempo em ms da mesma consulta com e sem indice.</li>
  <li>Em <strong>Cache</strong>, recarregue a pagina boa duas vezes: o segundo acesso quase nao tem SQL.</li>
  <li>Em <strong>API externa</strong> e <strong>CPU em Ruby</strong>, veja tempo que nao e' banco nem view.</li>
</ol>
